{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"aec9dfe82ab5889ef","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Audit R13 调研 agent `a3356c51d9d10daab` 关于 VeriPB PB-OPT 工业可用 + Lübke&Berg AAAI'25 plateau-based MaxSAT 的 claim。这是 follow-up source-verify audit。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n终末地路线图 R11 #6 VeriPB exporter 工时被 R13 从 90 min 改到 4-6h。R13 还**新增** P2 #30 \"plateau-based 动态阶段切换\"，引用 Lübke&Berg AAAI'25 思路。如果 paper 不存在或描述错了，新条目无依据。\n\n## R13 agent 的关键 claim（需要 audit）\n\n读 transcript 文件：`/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a3356c51d9d10daab.output`\n\n(1) **VeriPB CP'25 paper #21**: Koops/Le Berre/Myreen/Nordström/Oertel/Tan/Vinyals《Practically Feasible Proof Logging for Pseudo-Boolean Optimization》LIPIcs vol.340\n\n(2) **PB Comp 2025 主要 solver**: Exact、PRINTEMPS、NaPS、SCIP；RoundingSat 唯一用 unchecked deletion 模式\n\n(3) **PB Comp 2025 格式**: PB-OPT certificate **没有标准 ε-gap schema**\n\n(4) **cake_lpr 2026-02 升级 +5-10% 性能, binary -20%**\n\n(5) **Lübke & Berg, CP'25 (NOT AAAI'25!)**: \"SLS-Enhanced Core-Boosted Linear Search for Anytime Maximum Satisfiability\"\n注意 transcript 实际写 CP'25 不是 AAAI'25，但 R13 verdict 行写了 \"Lübke&Berg AAAI'25\"。这是矛盾，要 verify 哪个是对的。\n\n(6) **Bessa et al., AAAI'25**: \"Learning Valid Dual Bounds in CP: Boosted Lagrangian Decomposition with Self-Supervised Learning\"\n\n(7) **CP'24 Boudreault & Quimper**: \"Multi-Stage Proof Logging Framework for CP Solvers\"\n\n(8) **arXiv reference**: Bessa et al. arXiv 2408.12695\n\n## Audit 任务\n\n1. **CP'25 paper #21 (VeriPB)**: WebFetch `https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol340-cp2025/LIPIcs.CP.2025.21/LIPIcs.CP.2025.21.pdf`\n   - 标题、作者匹配？\n   - PB-OPT industrial logging 是 paper claim 吗？\n\n2. **CP'25 Lübke&Berg paper**: WebFetch `https://cp2025.a4cp.org/accepted_papers.html` 或 LIPIcs vol.340 找 SLS-Enhanced paper\n   - 标题、作者\n   - 是否真是 CP'25 不是 AAAI'25\n   - \"core-boosted linear search anytime\" 内容\n\n3. **Bessa et al. arXiv 2408.12695**: WebFetch `https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.12695`\n   - 标题、作者、abstract\n   - 是否 AAAI'25 还是别的会议\n\n4. **PB Competition 2025**: WebFetch `http://www.cril.univ-artois.fr/PB25/`\n   - main solver 列表\n   - PB-OPT cert 是否有 ε-gap track\n\n5. **CP'24 Boudreault & Quimper**: WebSearch \"Multi-Stage Proof Logging Framework Boudreault Quimper CP 2024\"\n   - paper 真存在？\n\n6. **cake_lpr SAT'25**: WebFetch `https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/downloads/checkers/cakelpr.pdf` 或类似\n   - 性能数字 +5-10% / -20% 是否真在那篇 paper 里\n\n每条 claim 标 CONFIRMED / PARTIALLY / REFUTED。\n\n## 输出格式（不超过 600 字，中文）\n\n```\n## 8 条 claim audit 结果\n| # | claim | verdict | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | VeriPB CP'25 #21 Koops 等 | ... | URL |\n| 2 | PB Comp 2025 solver 列表 | ... | |\n| ... | | | |\n\n## 关键修正\n[列错的, 特别注意 Lübke&Berg 是 CP'25 还是 AAAI'25]\n\n## 路线图修订建议\n- R11 #6 VeriPB exporter 工时 4-6h: 仍有效 / 修订\n- P2 #30 plateau-based 切换: 引用 paper 修正 / 维持 / 删\n- \"中间 ε-gap 没标准 schema\" claim: 仍有效 / 修订\n\n## verdict\nCONFIRMED / PARTIALLY / REFUTED\n```\n\n## 操作准则\n\n- 必须 WebFetch 实际 paper PDF / accepted papers list\n- 注意 transcript 内部矛盾（Lübke&Berg CP'25 vs AAAI'25）—— 我路线图 commit 写的是 AAAI'25, 这是抄错还是 transcript 写错\n- 简洁\n\n开始。"},"uuid":"88620ca9-2480-4612-9af2-5dcde74dee49","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:10.135Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
