{"parentUuid":"0902c931-6b95-4f88-a980-d99dddaa397c","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"aec9dfe82ab5889ef","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JrLD1GNqCMXr7ZCQCPgyhK","type":"tool_result","content":"<persisted-output>\nOutput too large (43.6KB). Full output saved to: /home/zhuran24/.claude/projects/-home-zhuran24-claude-pj-zmd/7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9/tool-results/bsnoaouvq.txt\n\nPreview (first 2KB):\n1:{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"64d71192-3b1b-4e70-aef9-d69f40568796\",\"agentId\":\"a3356c51d9d10daab\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"调研 anytime CP（带 incumbent 序列 / ε-bound certificate）相关工具链在 2025 H2 - 2026 H1 的新进展，跟我们项目 P1 #7 ε-Certified 三阶段 168h split 直接相关。\\n\\n## 项目背景\\n\\n终末地工业规划器 70×70 exact LBBD 求解器。**P1 #7（ε-Certified 三阶段）刚完成 prep + 主体 4 hooks 集成**：\\n- schema 加 bound_state（lb / ub / gap / epsilon_target / prover / model_hash）\\n- BendersCut 加 epsilon_stage tag\\n- master.fill_tightened_domains_in_response = True\\n- master.set_hint_persistence_context (load + apply / extract + write)\\n- LBBDController.set_epsilon_stage / extract_bound_state helper\\n- bound regression guard + audit log\\n\\n剩下：outer_search 三阶段切分调度（25h / 50h / 85h budget）+ VeriPB exporter 适配（路线图 R11 #6 候选，未做）。\\n\\n## 上次调研\\n\\n- R3 `a6480e76a7177e6fd`（2026-05-08）：ε-Certified 1-5% gap is 1000× acceleration direction\\n- R7 `a0ac44e2d03f4edb2`（2026-05-08）：5-day three-stage 5%→1%→0% with bound transfer\\n- R11 `a823b529b0879c4bb`（2026-05-08）：8 patches ~5h schema_v4 / cut bucket / fill_tightened / hint persistence / VeriPB export — revealed P1 #7 missing engineering layer\\n- R10 `acb9bd4fdd02868c2`（2026-05-08）：168h three-stage budget (25h/50h/85h) + 75h hard checkpoint + Stage-3 dual-growth diagnostic\\n\\n## 调研任务\\n\\n**用 WebSearch / WebFetch 查 学术 / 工具更新**：\\n\\n1. **VeriPB / cake_lpr 半年进展**:\\n   - GitHub: gitlab.com/MIAOresearch/software/VeriPB\\n   - 2025-2026 H1 release\\n   - 是否新增 PB-OPT 优化证书格式（针对 ε-bound proof，不只是 UNSAT）\\n   - cake_lpr 跟 PB Competition 2025 适配状态\\n\\n2. **新 anytime CP 工具**:\\n   - Lecoutre / Boussemart 新论文（2025 H2）\\n   - any2 / 之类 anytime SAT solver\\n   - CP 2025 / SAT 2025 上有没有 \\\"anytime certificate\\\" / \\\"ε-optimal proof\\\" paper\\n\\n3. **PB Competition 2025 结果**:\\n   - cril.univ-artois.fr/PB25\\n   - 哪些 solver 上分\\n   - PB-OPT vs PB-DEC track 的最新格式要求\\n\\n4. **ε-Certified 三阶段实施工程经验**:\\n   - 工业 LBBD anytime 实施案例（2025 paper）\\n   - 25h / 50h / 85h 时间分配是否被新研究质疑或验证\\n   - d\n...\n</persisted-output>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"09bf0e08-8a12-4476-89ef-fcdf4dbf63c1","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:20.420Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0902c931-6b95-4f88-a980-d99dddaa397c","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
