{"parentUuid":"e43c4e8c-855a-421c-848f-1b22e4cb6b9d","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aec9dfe82ab5889ef","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01S7GY4SozTTxk6dpNca2fQg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Bemzr7xVnmqUmw3iFWMtYm","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a3356c51d9d10daab.output') as f:\n    for i, line in enumerate(f):\n        try:\n            d = json.loads(line)\n            t = d.get('type','')\n            msg = d.get('message',{})\n            content = msg.get('content','')\n            if isinstance(content, list):\n                for c in content:\n                    if c.get('type')=='text':\n                        text = c.get('text','')\n                        # find key claims\n                        for kw in ['Lübke','Lubke','Berg','AAAI','CP\\'25','CP 2025','plateau','2408.12695','Bessa','Boudreault','cake_lpr','Koops','Nordström','verdict','LIPIcs.CP.2025','Quimper','core-boost']:\n                            if kw.lower() in text.lower():\n                                # print surrounding 200 chars\n                                idx = text.lower().find(kw.lower())\n                                snippet = text[max(0,idx-150):idx+300]\n                                print(f'--- line {i} kw=[{kw}] ---')\n                                print(snippet)\n                                print()\n                                break\n        except Exception as e:\n            pass\n\" | head -300\n","description":"Extract key claim snippets from transcript"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1812,"cache_read_input_tokens":27897,"output_tokens":555,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1812},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":555,"cache_read_input_tokens":27897,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1812,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1812,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011Castjzx7xTYZYaWresePX","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7a73d50-fe6b-4517-94ac-03b2f3bb5d4b","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:27.712Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b7a73d50-fe6b-4517-94ac-03b2f3bb5d4b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"aec9dfe82ab5889ef","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bemzr7xVnmqUmw3iFWMtYm","type":"tool_result","content":"--- line 19 kw=[CP'25] ---\n找到关键 paper \"Practically Feasible Proof Logging for Pseudo-Boolean Optimization\" CP'25。再深入查几个：\n\n--- line 37 kw=[Lübke] ---\n最终 lb=ub\"，不天然支持中间 ε-gap 证书**。R11 #6 想做的\"导出 ε-bound certificate\"得自定义把 epsilon_stage 的 lb 写成 PB 约束 + 单独 cert，没有现成 schema。\n\n## 新 anytime CP / SAT 论文\n- **Lübke & Berg, CP'25** \"SLS-Enhanced Core-Boosted Linear Search for Anytime Maximum Satisfiability\"——核心 + SLS hybrid 改 anytime MaxSAT 收益曲线，思路可借鉴：早期 SLS 灌 incumbent / 后期 core-guided 收 lb，跟 P1 #7 三阶段（5%→1%→0%）阶段分工同构。\n- **Bessa et al., AAAI'25** \"Learning Valid Dual Bounds in CP: Boosted Lagrangian Deco","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ddfaad9c-f073-49a3-8715-4dfab8b9e955","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:27.753Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b7a73d50-fe6b-4517-94ac-03b2f3bb5d4b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ddfaad9c-f073-49a3-8715-4dfab8b9e955","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"aec9dfe82ab5889ef","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_017eYyxNcCJy9GXW86dvmc1F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017MZjHohNueWgH4kRpDCr2e","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json\nwith open('/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/a3356c51d9d10daab.output') as f:\n    for i, line in enumerate(f):\n        try:\n            d = json.loads(line)\n            msg = d.get('message',{})\n            content = msg.get('content','')\n            if isinstance(content, list):\n                for c in content:\n                    if c.get('type')=='text':\n                        text = c.get('text','')\n                        if 'Lübke' in text or 'Bessa' in text or 'Quimper' in text or 'PB Comp' in text or 'cake_lpr' in text or 'verdict' in text.lower():\n                            print(f'=== LINE {i} ===')\n                            print(text[:5000])\n                            print()\n        except: pass\n\" \n","description":"Extract full text from claim-bearing lines"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":966,"cache_read_input_tokens":29709,"output_tokens":370,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":966},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":370,"cache_read_input_tokens":29709,"cache_creation_input_tokens":966,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":966,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CastkYH2fWsPRfHMfhuQL","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"b6af73d7-dadf-4cd5-955d-fa0613cd627f","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:32.221Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"b6af73d7-dadf-4cd5-955d-fa0613cd627f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"aec9dfe82ab5889ef","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017MZjHohNueWgH4kRpDCr2e","type":"tool_result","content":"=== LINE 37 ===\n证据足够，写最终调研报告。\n\n## VeriPB / cake_lpr 半年进展\n- **VeriPB 进了 CP'25**：Koops/Le Berre/Myreen/Nordström/Oertel/Tan/Vinyals 在 CP 2025 发了《Practically Feasible Proof Logging for Pseudo-Boolean Optimization》（LIPIcs vol.340 #21），第一次把 PB 优化的 proof logging 推到工业可用——给 RoundingSat / Sat4j 全套技术（core-guided + LP/Farkas + cut）做了 logging。这是\"PB-OPT 真正能用\"的转折点。\n- **PB Comp 2025**：4 条 unconditional track（PBS/PBO 各带证书 + 不带），新增 parametric scaling 实验 track。VeriPB 是默认 checker，认证条目不通过 checker 就降为非 certified。**没有独立的\"dual bound 证书 / ε-gap 证书\"track**——证书还是 OPT/UNSAT 二值，没有 anytime 中间 bound 的标准格式。\n- **cake_lpr** 2026-02 升级 +5–10% 性能、binary -20%；CakePB 走 cake_pb 分支，和 VeriPB 是配对的 verified checker。\n- **跟 P1 #7 适配难度**：核心结论——**PB-OPT 证书目前只能证\"最终 lb=ub\"，不天然支持中间 ε-gap 证书**。R11 #6 想做的\"导出 ε-bound certificate\"得自定义把 epsilon_stage 的 lb 写成 PB 约束 + 单独 cert，没有现成 schema。\n\n## 新 anytime CP / SAT 论文\n- **Lübke & Berg, CP'25** \"SLS-Enhanced Core-Boosted Linear Search for Anytime Maximum Satisfiability\"——核心 + SLS hybrid 改 anytime MaxSAT 收益曲线，思路可借鉴：早期 SLS 灌 incumbent / 后期 core-guided 收 lb，跟 P1 #7 三阶段（5%→1%→0%）阶段分工同构。\n- **Bessa et al., AAAI'25** \"Learning Valid Dual Bounds in CP: Boosted Lagrangian Decomposition with Self-Supervised Learning\"——learned dual bound for CP，跟 P1 #7 stage-3 dual-growth 慢的诊断方向相关；不是直接可用，但说明 ML-aided bound transfer 有 SOTA。\n- 没找到题为\"anytime ε-optimal certificate\"的 paper——这块仍是空白学术方向。\n- **CP'24** Boudreault & Quimper《Multi-Stage Proof Logging Framework for CP Solvers》是 P1 #7 多阶段 logging 的 prior art，CP'25 没续作。\n\n## PB Comp 2025\n- 主要 solver：Exact、PRINTEMPS、NaPS、SCIP；RoundingSat 唯一用 unchecked deletion 模式的。\n- 格式：跟 PB24 同（OPB + VeriPB pbp），无 ε-gap 扩展。\n\n## 工程实施案例\n- **25h/50h/85h 三阶段**：找不到任何 2025-2026 文献 corroborate 或 refute 这个具体切分；Lübke&Berg anytime MaxSAT 强调\"核心切换时机由 plateau detect\"而不是固定时间——跟我们硬切 25h/50h 不同，可能是个潜在改进点（动态切换 vs 固定 budget）。\n- **dual-growth diagnostic**：未见同名实战报告。Bessa et al. 提到 Lagrangian dual 在 CP 收敛慢的标准诊断是\"bound improvement per iter < ε for K iter\"——跟我们 75h hard checkpoint 同思路，validation 半侧。\n\n## verdict\n- **VeriPB exporter（R11 #6）原 90 min 估时升到 4-6h**：CP'25 paper 说明工具链已实用，但 ε-bound 中间证书**没有标准 schema**——要自己写 epsilon_stage→PB 约束 transcoder + 一次性 certify 每个 stage 的 lb。建议先做 Stage-3 的 final OPT cert，中间 ε-gap cert 暂缓。\n- **路线图新加 1 项**：参考 Lübke&Berg，把 P1 #7 的\"固定 25h/50h/85h\"加一个 plateau-based 动态切换 fallback（Stage-2 提前进 Stage-3 if dual_growth_rate < threshold for 4h）——估时 2h，纯调度逻辑。\n- **P1 #7 主流程引用**：可在 epsilon_stage tag 注释处引 CP'25 #21 (Koops et al.) 作 PB-OPT certified path 的 prior art；引 Lübke&Berg anytime MaxSAT 解释多阶段切换。算法本身不动。\n- **核心 takeaway**：PB-OPT 半年内变得\"工业可用\"但没扩展到 anytime ε-cert，我们的 schema 是\"对的方向但走在 standard 前面\"，自定义 transcoder 不可避免。\n\nSources:\n- [CP'25 Practically Feasible Proof Logging for PB Optimization](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol340-cp2025/LIPIcs.CP.2025.21/LIPIcs.CP.2025.21.pdf)\n- [PB Competition 2025](http://www.cril.univ-artois.fr/PB25/)\n- [VeriPB+CakePB SAT'25 docs](https://jakobnordstrom.se/docs/publications/DocumentationVeriPBandCakePBforSATcompetition2025.pdf)\n- [cake_lpr SAT'25](https://satcompetition.github.io/2025/downloads/checkers/cakelpr.pdf)\n- [CP 2025 accepted papers](https://cp2025.a4cp.org/accepted_papers.html)\n- [Bessa et al. AAAI'25 Learning Valid Dual Bounds in CP](https://arxiv.org/abs/2408.12695)\n- [CP'24 Multi-Stage Proof Logging](https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol307-cp2024/LIPIcs.CP.2024.11/LIPIcs.CP.2024.11.pdf)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"995ecbac-b758-4575-b143-cfe6e4d43303","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:32.262Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b6af73d7-dadf-4cd5-955d-fa0613cd627f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/c