{"parentUuid":"6b73a80b-4630-4d6b-8eb6-e40051aedf47","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"aec9dfe82ab5889ef","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011VT8VwAS7MPx3VKcu4MbaL","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"Multi-Stage Proof Logging Framework\" Boudreault Quimper CP 2024\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"dblp: CP 2024\",\"url\":\"https://dblp.org/db/conf/cp/cp2024.html\"},{\"title\":\"A Multi-Stage Proof Logging Framework to Certify the Correctness of CP Solvers\",\"url\":\"https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol307-cp2024/LIPIcs.CP.2024.11/LIPIcs.CP.2024.11.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Google Scholar\",\"url\":\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar?q=A+Multi-Stage+Proof+Logging+Framework+to+Certify+the+Correctness+of+CP+Solvers.\"},{\"title\":\"CP 2024 Accepted Papers\",\"url\":\"https://cp2024.a4cp.org/accepted_papers.html\"},{\"title\":\"dblp: CVIP 2024 (II)\",\"url\":\"https://dblp.org/db/conf/cvip/cvip2024-2.html\"},{\"title\":\"dblp: CVIP 2024 (V)\",\"url\":\"https://dblp.org/db/conf/cvip/cvip2024-5.html\"},{\"title\":\"Cumulative Scheduling with Calendars and Overtime Samuel Cloutier #\",\"url\":\"https://drops.dagstuhl.de/storage/00lipics/lipics-vol307-cp2024/LIPIcs.CP.2024.7/LIPIcs.CP.2024.7.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Éloi - Toute l'équipe d'Eloi Boudreault Construction vous ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/eloiboudreaultconstruction/photos/toute-l%C3%A9quipe-deloi-boudreault-construction-vous-souhaite-la-bienvenue-en-2024-q/923760652567300/\"},{\"title\":\"Au printemps 2024, le professeur Pierre-Luc Boudreault s' ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.facebook.com/fmss.USherbrooke/posts/au-printemps-2024-le-professeur-pierre-luc-boudreault-sest-rendu-%C3%A0-luniversit%C3%A9-p/1121538653344616/\"},{\"title\":\"Integration of Constraint Programming, Artificial Intelligence, and Operations Research: 21st International Conference, CPAIOR 2024, Uppsala, Sweden, May 28–31, 2024, Proceedings, Part I | SpringerLink\",\"url\":\"https://link.springer.com/book/10.1007/978-3-031-60597-0\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about the paper you're looking for:\n\n\"A Multi-Stage Proof Logging Framework to Certify the Correctness of CP Solvers\" was presented at CP 2024. The paper is authored by Maarten Flippo, Konstantin Sidorov, Imko Marijnissen, Jeff Smits, and Emir Demirovic.\n\nHowever, I should note that your search query included \"Boudreault Quimper,\" but these authors do not appear to be associated with this particular paper. It's possible you may have been thinking of a different paper, as Claude-Guy Quimper is listed as an author on \"Cumulative Scheduling with Calendars and Overtime\" at the same conference.\n\nThe multi-stage proof logging framework paper divides the proof generation into three steps, with the CP solver required to only produce a proof sketch called a scaffold at runtime.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"14e35f72-ae9b-4d48-9fcf-d696b930fe98","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:51:51.543Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6b73a80b-4630-4d6b-8eb6-e40051aedf47","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
